<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nelson said downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nelson said downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber downgraded Thomas Nelson Inc to neutral from attractive, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 13-1/2 Thursday.</p>
</text>
